<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian five-week T-notes yield 5.860 pct.</title>
<headline>Australian five-week T-notes yield 5.860 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   5.860	 5.86 only   5.880</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 50)</p>
</text>
